---
description: Bump the shared version and write each repo's changelog when committing
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user asks to commit, ship, or release a change, read and follow `.cursor/skills/release-commit/SKILL.md` before committing. Set the shared version with `node scripts/release.mjs --shared` from `.cursor/skills/release-commit`. Pick patch, minor, or major, or the version they named. `domdoc-sdk`, `domdoc-wasm`, `domdoc-api`, `domdoc-website`, and `domdoc-benchmarks` share that version number and keep separate changelogs. Commit only when they asked to commit.
